 REPEAT:120:phrase expands to the phrase 120 times. Any harness reading this file must expand it — chapter 15 forgot to , which made the long-context prompt 37 tokens instead of 2,201 and produced a false pass on the exam. --- ## 2 · The eval harness The serving harness answers *how fast*. It cannot answer *was that right*, and chapter 21 showed a model completing every task while getting two thirds of them wrong. ### Ground truth is computed, never stored ```python
